@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:reliability] additive-schema-reconciliation
The migration MUST create the missing schema objects for a database built from prior migrations
and MUST preserve existing records when the same objects were already created by schema push.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:reliability] incomplete-existing-tables-fail
An existing reconciled table missing a required column MUST cause migration failure instead of
silently accepting an incomplete table.
